<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '48px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>一个“愁”字，够不够用</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>主问题</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, justifyContent: 'center', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>全词只写一个“愁”，</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>为什么结尾说“怎一个愁字了得”？</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 40 }}>这个问题，全课只答一次。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8 }}>
